  <h2>It's probably not a traffic problem</h2>

  <p>Here's something I hear a lot: "I'm getting views, but nobody's buying." Sound familiar?</p>

  <p>If you've been posting consistently, getting saves, maybe even some followers — but making zero sales — the issue almost certainly isn't reach. <strong>It's that there's no system catching all that attention and turning it into something.</strong></p>

  <p>That system is called a funnel. It's just the path someone walks from discovering you to trusting you enough to buy. When the path is clear, people follow it naturally. When it's missing or broken, they scroll past and forget you existed five minutes later.</p>

